              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Metaa inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Ore tena kata naa kashukoki Yakobo imayianat enyena, natum olng'ur te nkaji pooki e Israel; naaku oloota olom te nkaraki enkarna ai sinyati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kerikino ninche enkurruna enye, o mbaa pooki torrok naataasa ninche aagilunore nanu, ina kata etoni te seriani te nkop enye meeta likae oiture ninche, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ina kata nayau ninche ashuku too loreren naiturrurru ninche aitung'uaa ilmang'ati le nkop enye, naa tiatua ninche aibalie esinyatisho ai edolita iloreren kumok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina peyie eyiolou aajo ara nanu Olaitoriani Enkai enye amu aterewa ninche eararoto tiatua iloreren, naitoki aiturrurroki ninche enkop enye maate. Maing'uaa hoo obo lenye eton tiatua iloreren aitoki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nemaitoki aikata aisudoo enkomom ai aigil te ninche, ina kata nabuku Enkiyang'et abukoki ina aji Israel, ejo Olaitoriani Enkai.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.29"
            ]
